5. RuntimeObservedWorkContext and Public API Audit
===============================================================================

RuntimeObservedWorkContextV02 is the only new public dataclass. It is declared
with the import-bound @_dataclass(frozen=True) decorator and is runtime-only.
KernelArtifactV01 remains the only serialized observed-work identity/evidence
carrier. No observed-work serialized dataclass, ABI literal, authority class,
topology owner, successor baseline, PlanGraph adapter, migration, or
compatibility ownership path was introduced.

The exact 33-field RuntimeObservedWorkContextV02 order is:
  observed_work_context_id
  context_version
  context_profile_id
  baseline_execution_bundle
  baseline_bundle_anchor_sha256
  runtime_source_binding_id
  topology_id
  topology_artifact_id
  baseline_runtime_trace_id
  baseline_runtime_report_id
  baseline_report_artifact_id
  execution_scope
  whole_run_escalation_reason
  whole_run_escalation_policy_id
